17
00:00:40,840 --> 00:00:41,836
Nu face lucrurile mai

18
00:00:41,836 --> 00:00:42,880
complicate decât sunt.

19
00:00:42,920 --> 00:00:44,449
Chiar vrei să pleci de lângă noi,

20
00:00:44,449 --> 00:00:45,760
