35
00:01:19,240 --> 00:01:20,360
-Domn aici.
-Generale Macgee.

36
00:01:20,800 --> 00:01:22,600
Fiule, e timpul.

37
00:01:23,240 --> 00:01:24,425
Cine e tânărul ăla?

38
00:01:24,425 --> 00:01:25,360
Pare important.

39
00:01:26,320 --> 00:01:28,951
Mai am de făcut ceva înainte de lansare.

40
00:01:28,951 --> 00:01:29,280
Bine.

41
00:01:35,120 --> 00:01:37,560
Oh, stați!

